      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "Effect Layer service whose implementation functions are Effect.fn closures inside Layer.effect; the anchored SUMMARY_TEMPLATE enforces a fixed Markdown section order so summaries can be incrementally updated across compactions."
    },
